  <tbody>
    <tr><td style="text-align: center;">A</td><td>Notice Classification</td><td>Accuracy / Macro-F1</td><td>53.3% / 46.2%</td><td>70.0% / 64.8%</td><td><strong>76.7% / 71.1%</strong></td></tr>
    <tr><td style="text-align: center;">B</td><td>Named Entity Extraction</td><td>Field Exact Match</td><td>68.4%</td><td>82.5%</td><td><strong>93.0% (53/57)</strong></td></tr>
    <tr><td style="text-align: center;">C</td><td>Temporal Normalization</td><td>Timestamp Res. (IST)</td><td>58.8%</td><td>70.6%</td><td><strong>94.1% (16/17)</strong></td></tr>
    <tr><td style="text-align: center;">D</td><td>Deliverable Synthesis</td><td>Zero Fabrication</td><td>70.0%</td><td>80.0%</td><td><strong>92.5% (37/40)</strong></td></tr>
    <tr><td style="text-align: center;">E</td><td>5-Way Change Intelligence</td><td>Relation Accuracy</td><td>38.5%</td><td>61.5%</td><td><strong>76.9% (10/13)</strong></td></tr>
    <tr><td style="text-align: center;">F</td><td>Priority Intelligence</td><td>Score Invariance</td><td>100% (Static)</td><td>N/A</td><td><strong>100% Invariant</strong></td></tr>
    <tr><td style="text-align: center;">G</td><td>Workload Intelligence</td><td>Horizon Partitioning</td><td>75.0%</td><td>85.0%</td><td><strong>100% (20/20)</strong></td></tr>
    <tr><td style="text-align: center;">H</td><td>Notification Dispatcher</td><td>Quiet Hours Comp.</td><td>80.0%</td><td>80.0%</td><td><strong>100% (20/20)</strong></td></tr>
    <tr><td style="text-align: center;">I</td><td>Grounded Assistant</td><td>Gating Confirmation</td><td>64.5%</td><td>77.4%</td><td><strong>100% (31/31)</strong></td></tr>
    <tr><td style="text-align: center;">J</td><td>Multimodal OCR Quality</td><td>CER / WER</td><td>N/A</td><td>N/A</td><td><strong>CER 3.19%, WER 18.9%</strong></td></tr>
    <tr><td style="text-align: center;">K</td><td>Syllabus Curriculum</td><td>Unit Mapping Acc.</td><td>68.8%</td><td>81.3%</td><td><strong>100% (16/16)</strong></td></tr>
    <tr><td style="text-align: center;">L</td><td>Contradiction Detection</td><td>Conflict Flagging</td><td>50.0%</td><td>68.8%</td><td><strong>100% (16/16)</strong></td></tr>
    <tr><td style="text-align: center;">M</td><td>Rubric Criteria</td><td>Weight Sum = 100%</td><td>62.5%</td><td>75.0%</td><td><strong>100% (16/16)</strong></td></tr>
    <tr><td style="text-align: center;">N</td><td>Academic Risk Radar</td><td>Trigger Calibration</td><td>66.7%</td><td>81.0%</td><td><strong>100% (21/21)</strong></td></tr>
    <tr><td style="text-align: center;">O</td><td>Smart Academic Planner</td><td>Schedule Synthesis</td><td>71.4%</td><td>85.7%</td><td><strong>100% (21/21)</strong></td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<p><strong>Error Analysis (3 Failures on Unseen TEST Split):</strong> (1) <em>TS-001:</em> Dual-intent circular categorized as ASSIGNMENT instead of EXAM; both deliverables extracted to timeline; (2) <em>TS-009:</em> Non-academic sports circular synthesized 1 task; (3) <em>TS-001 Priority:</em> Distant exam classified as Medium rather than Critical to prevent panic.</p>

<!-- ==================== 11. USER INTERFACE ==================== -->
<h2>11. USER INTERFACE</h2>
<p>The web platform contains 8 responsive modules: Fig. 1 Student Dashboard; Fig. 2 Academic Notice Ingestion (/inbox); Fig. 3 Tasks & Evidence Traceability (/tasks); Fig. 4 Dynamic Syllabus Calendar (/calendar); Fig. 5 Cognitive Workload Radar & Smart Planner; Fig. 6 Faculty Course Intelligence & Roster (/faculty-course-intelligence); Fig. 7 Syllabus & Rubric Management; Fig. 8 AI-Assisted Faculty Review Queue (/faculty-review).</p>

